# Google GenAI Migration Walkthrough

## Summary
Successfully migrated the **GentleQuest** backend from the legacy `google-generativeai` (v0.x) library to the modernized `google-genai` (v1.0+) library. This involved refactoring the core [DualEngineLLM](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/runtime/llm_client.py#26-139) client to be V1-native and updating all dependent providers and scripts.

## Changes Overview

### 1. Unified LLM Client
- Refactored [mcp_server_nucleus/runtime/llm_client.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/runtime/llm_client.py) to use `google-genai` exclusively.
- Removed "Legacy" engine fallback logic.
- Implemented correct strict tool configuration for V1 SDK.

### 2. Core Providers Migrated
The following providers now rely solely on the unified client:
- [providers/gemini.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/providers/gemini.py) (Main Chat & Tool Calling)
- [providers/embeddings.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/providers/embeddings.py) (Vector Embeddings)
- [providers/memory.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/providers/memory.py) (Summarization & RAG)
- [providers/safety.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/providers/safety.py) (Moderation Guardrails)

### 3. Scripts & Features Migrated
- [community.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/community.py): AI Moderation now uses V1.
- [brain_executor.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/brain_executor.py): Autonomous agents now use V1.
- [scripts/test_critic_llm.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/scripts/test_critic_llm.py): Critic tests updated.
- [test_wellness_direct.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/test_wellness_direct.py): Wellness function verified.

## Verification

### Automated Function Calling Test
We verified the V1 client's ability to handle ambiguous vs. clear intent with the "Wellness Intervention" tool.

**Test:** [test_wellness_direct.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/test_wellness_direct.py)
**Result:**
- Input: "I'm feeling very anxious right now" -> ✅ **Function Called** (`get_wellness_intervention`)
- Input: "I am stressed" -> ⚠️ **Clarification Asked** (Correct behavior, missing parameters)

### Brain Status Check
We verified the autonomous agent runtime is healthy.
**Test:** `brain status`
**Result:**
```
Gemini API: Available
Agents: synthesizer, researcher, strategist, architect, developer, critic
Pending Tasks: 0
```

## Next Steps
The system is now fully running on `google-genai` v1.0+.
- Monitor logs for any edge cases in production.
- Future work: Implement `features/image.py` using V1 if needed.
